issue_context.body:
### The problem

Some of the entities for a WOLF Link ISM7 with CHA 7 Heatpump are missing units. Thus their values are not showable as a history chart in entities details..

Because all power sensors dont have units, they are not convertet to german numbering 
(For example "Heat generator 1 Current secondary power" 2.6 should be 2,6 kW)
German conversions do work for e.g. Temperatures.



### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?

core-2025.2.3

### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?

none (first usage of home assistant and Wolf SmartSet Service integration)

### What type of installation are you running?

Home Assistant OS

### Integration causing the issue

Wolf SmartSet Service, label:"integration: wolflink" 

### Link to integration documentation on our website

https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/wolflink/

